      "cml:operator": "CONTAINS",
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) an application is made for a road transport contractual chain order under subsection 536PE(1) or for a variation of a road transport contractual chain order under section 536PS; or (b) the FWC is considering making or varying a road transport contractual chain order on its own initiative."
