      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:description": "(2) The underpayment amount the contravention is associated with is, to the extent it can be determined by the court, the difference between: (a) the required amount mentioned in paragraph (1)(a); and (b) the amount (including a nil amount) the employer actually paid to, on behalf of, or for the benefit of, the employee on account of the required amount.",
