      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "prepared-by-the-office-of-parliamentary-counsel-canberra-fair-work-act-2009.pdf, p.182",
      "skos:note": "The FWC may determine that the approval is as valid and effective, and is taken to have been as valid and effective, as it would have been if certain conditions were met.",
